for its repeal. And it just so happens that&nbsp;
he only comes out and talks about it publicly.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:24.720
Days after we learn hours, in fact, after we&nbsp;
learn that one of the possible crimes that Trump&nbsp;&nbsp;

